# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore. The build context is now this backend repo's
# root (not the umbrella), so the paths below are repo-relative.
#
# Keeping .env out of the image is load-bearing: it would otherwise bake the
# OpenAI key into the layer. (It can no longer clobber the container's injected
# DATABASE_URL — api/main.py loads .env without override=True, so real env wins.)
.venv
.git
__pycache__
.env
*.md
